{"id":"conv_04434","context":"A uni student interviews a retired executive about innovation","ambient":"office_quiet_low","cast":["hiroshi_elder","ren_uni"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"Thank you for your time today, and please allow me to apologize first for visiting so suddenly.","jp":"本日はお時間をいただき、まずは突然の訪問について謝罪させてください。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,3,4,5,19,56,75,111,196,245,944,1323,1429,1504,1645,1760,4749,4946,5281,5804,8041,9154,14568],"jpTokens":[{"s":"本日","r":"ほんじつ","w":944},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"お","w":56},{"s":"時間","r":"じかん","w":111},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"いただき","w":1429},{"s":"、"},{"s":"まずは","w":1760},{"s":"突然","r":"とつぜん","w":1645},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"訪問","r":"ほうもん","w":1504},{"s":"について","w":75},{"s":"謝罪","r":"しゃざい","w":4946},{"s":"さ","w":19},{"s":"せ","w":245},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"ください","w":4749},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":null,"en":"Don't worry about it. Talking with young people is enjoyable. What did you want to ask?","jp":"気にせんでええ。若い人と話すのは楽しいもんじゃ。何が聞きたいんかね?","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,3,6,9,16,19,21,26,30,51,62,70,132,150,830,904,1017,1055,1091,2024,2861,3039,3631,9856,12368,14196],"jpTokens":[{"s":"気","r":"き","w":150},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"せ","w":19},{"s":"ん","w":26},{"s":"で","w":21},{"s":"ええ","w":3039},{"s":"。"},{"s":"若い","r":"わかい","w":1055},{"s":"人","r":"ひと","w":30},{"s":"と","w":9},{"s":"話す","r":"はなす","w":2024},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"楽しい","r":"たのしい","w":1091},{"s":"もん","w":830},{"s":"じゃ","w":132},{"s":"。"},{"s":"何","r":"なに","w":70},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"聞き","r":"きき","w":1017},{"s":"たい","w":62},{"s":"ん","w":26},{"s":"か","w":16},{"s":"ね","w":51},{"s":"?"}]},{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"It's about the business you've run for many years — I'd like to hear about any moments where you produced new value.","jp":"御社が長年行なってきた事業についてなんですが、その中で新しい価値を生み出した瞬間があれば伺いたいんです。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[4,5,6,7,8,17,22,26,33,41,43,55,62